In an attempt to improve the general veracity of the busmouse HOWTO, it
would be appreciated if all Linux bus mouse users could answer the
following simple questions and email the results to me at

	mike@starbug.apana.org.au

Following up to this message should also work.
Thanks in advance.


	1) What sort of bus mouse do you have?  If you don't know the
	   exact name and model, give as much detail as you have,
	   including when you bought it and a description of the mouse,
	   card and plug/interface between the two.

	2) Which of the bus mouse protocols do you use to get your mouse
	   working under Linux?  This is whichever of the bus mice options
	   you select when you compile a new kernel.  If you do not know,
	   check the bootup message to see which mouse type is detected.

