As everyone with email access has noticed (and seen fit to either tell
me or post about) sunsite.unc.edu has ben having some trouble recently.
The reason is a massive system upgrade, new daemons, new operating
system, and general bad vibes (this had nothing to do with DOOM).

Files have been corrupted, erased, misplaced, or just not usefull. We are
working to fix the troubles, but it won't happen overnight. In the meantime,
you'll be better off using a mirror site. A list of them is in
/pub/Linux/MIRRORS (or http://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/MIRRORS.html). They'll
be much more reliable for a little while yet.

All of my mirrors should keep mirroring sunsite, as things should keep
improving. 

While I'm at it, here's a new file list. Yes, I know Incoming is still a 
mess, but I'm working on it.

Thanks for your patience,

Erik

