   If you want to install the DFN-RPC on PC with LINUX then you must use
   ftp://ftp.uni-stuttgart.de/pub/rus/dfn_rpc/dfn_rpc_1.0.49alpha.tar.Z
   =

        PAPERS ABOUT THE DFN-RPC IN ENGLISH OR GERMAN AND RELATED WORKS
                                       =

