         ftp.dfv.rwth-aachen.de         137.226.4.111    /pub/linux
         ftp.informatik.rwth-aachen.de  137.226.225.3    /pub/Linux
         ftp.Germany.EU.net             192.76.144.75    /pub/os/Linux
         ftp.ibp.fr                     132.227.60.2     /pub/linux
